LANGUAGE English
DEBUG OFF

BOOK BenAfter RANDOM NO KEEP
    IF exploredDiningRoom EXIT

    PROLOG
        TEXT "Benjamin looks around the room, like is he trying to figure out what you are doing."
    END PAGE PROLOG

    PAGE Dirt
        BUTTON "<<Is the whole house this dirty?>>"

        TEXT "
            <<Well,>> he starts, <<10 years ago the house was packed quickly and then close up. There has
            been no one here since then, so expect the worst.>>
    
            You are not encouraged.
        "

        IF NOT exploredBackyardNicely THEN TEXT "
            <<Well,>> he snaps, <<the house sat unused these last 10 years. You were hired to clean, not criticize.>>
        
            This man clearly does not like you.
        "

        EPILOG "Benjamin seems surprised you asked about dirt. Odd since you were hired to clean."
    END PAGE Dirt
    
    PAGE Footprints
        BUTTON "<<There are footprints in the dust by that door...>>"
        
        TEXT "<<I think the handyman was in the house yesterday. They must be his.>>"
        
        IF NOT exploredBackyardNicely THEN TEXT "
            <<Then you should sweep it up. That>s what you>re here for, not to complain about dirt.>>
        "

        EPILOG """
			You notice Benjamin glancing nervously at the footprints. <i>Is something going
			on?" you wonder.
		"""
    END PAGE Footprints

    PAGE AnythingElse
        BUTTON "<<Is there anything else we need to know?>>"
    
        REMOVE TokenBackyardBenAfter
        ADD TokenExploreBackDoorLocked!, TokenInvestigatorsDiningRoom
        
		TEXT "
            <<Oh, my, yes. Here's the key you'll need to open doors throughout the house.>>
    
            Gain the {c:QItemBrassKey} common item.
    
            <<I must be going. Take your time and send someone to fetch me if you need anything.>>
        
            Move any investigators who are outside one space into the {c:TileDiningRoom}.
			
			Ben shuts the door behind you. <i>Was that the lock turning?</i>
			you ask yourself. Place an Explore token as indicated and remove Ben
			from the board.
        "
    
        IF NOT exploredBackyardNicely THEN TEXT "
            <<What?>> he growls. <<Oh, here's the key to the house. Don't lose it.>>
        
            As he turns to walk out, he drops the key in your direction. Place the {c:QItemBrassKey} common item
            in Ben's space. Once outside, Benjamin barks, <<Everyone inside. No dawdling.>>

			Move any investigators who are outside one space into the {C:TileDiningRoom}.
        
            Ben slams the door shut behind him. <i>Was that the lock turning?<i> you 
			ask yourself. Place an Explore token as indicated
			and remove Ben from the board.
        "
    
		REMOVE TokenInvestigatorsDiningRoom AFTER
		
		TRIGGER @ClearAllMythosFlags
		
		$mythosHelp = TRUE
		$mythosFlavor = TRUE
		$mythosMinor = TRUE
		$mythosIndoors = TRUE
        $MythosKey = TRUE
    	$mythosDiningRoom = TRUE
			
		talkedToBenAnythingElse = TRUE 
        talkedToBenCount = talkedToBenCount + 1

        TRIGGER @TalkedToBenAfter AFTER
    END PAGE AnythingElse
	
	PAGE AnythingElseJournal
		PAGE IS VISIBILE IF NOT foundJournal
		
		ADD TokenDiningRoomJournal!
		
		TEXT """
			At your feet you see a book that looks identical to the one Benjamin dropped outside.
			He seems to have dropped it again. <i>How is that possible?>> you ask yourself. Place
			a Search token as indicated.
			
			Something here doesn't feel right.
		"""
		EXIT
	 END PAGE AnythingElseJournal
 END BOOK BenAfter
